	I find it quite accurate.  As a member of the Academy that made all 
accepted
changes in TLI Loglan, I am not aware of any Academy member paying any 
attention
to changes made in Lojban.  If some of the changes  coincided, or dealt 
with the same
perceived problems, it was coincidental.  I am aware of one exception 
to this.  Lojbab
pointed out to us an ambiguity in Loglan serial names, which we 
corrected, while preserving the right to use la and hoi in names.  It 
is of course possible that changes
were suggested to us by members who were on both lists, without telling 
us of a
Lojban association, but, in fact, most changes were initiated from 
within the Academy.

